    "id": 46395,
    "type": "numeric",
    "title": "What will be the Cali Fund's total deposits received, in US dollars, as shown on the UNDP MPTF portal on October 31, 2026?",
    "description": "[stripped for the M1-363 fixture: not read by the conversion]",
    "resolution_criteria": "This question resolves to the \"Total Deposits\" figure for the Cali Fund (fund code CAL00) as displayed in the Financials / Financial Status section of the UNDP Multi-Partner Trust Fund Office portal at https://mptf.undp.org/fund/cal00 when checked on or after October 31, 2026 (using the most recent value the portal reports for the period through October 31, 2026). The value is the cumulative deposits received from all contributors, in US dollars (e.g., a displayed value of $7,085 resolves as 7085). If the \"Total Deposits\" line is not shown, the \"Total Source of Funds\" figure on the same page will be used instead. If the portal is permanently unavailable, [credible sources](https://www.metaculus.com/faq/#definitions) or official UNDP MPTF Office reports reporting the cumulative Cali Fund deposits will be used.",
